    "description": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">Heirloom varieties include : Pruden's Purple, Striped German, Tiffen Mennonite, &amp; Oxheart. Heirloom tomatoes are known for their exceptional flavor, often described as sweet, juicy, and complex. They boast a wide array of colors, shapes, and sizes, making them visually appealing as well. Their delicate nature means they're best enjoyed fresh or lightly cooked, enhancing their vibrant taste.</span></p>",
